            <span id="slip-days-calc">
              <strong>Calculation Method:</strong> Total Working Hours = 30 days × 8 hrs = 240 hrs. 
              Hourly Rate = Basic ÷ Total Hours. Overtime Hourly Rate = Hourly Rate × 1.25 (Oman Labor Law Standard 125%). 
              Overtime Earning = OT Hours × OT Rate.
            </span>
